### Happy path (all fields have defaults)
POST http://localhost:3000/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "acme-gmbh",
  "containers": 2,
  "containerType": "40HC",
  "originPort": "CNSHA",
  "destinationPort": "NLRTM",
  "finalDestinationCity": "Duisburg",
  "cargoDescription": "Solar panels",
  "hsCode": "854143",
  "cargoValueEur": 120000
}

### Fails at the warehouse, compensates trucking, customs, ocean
POST http://localhost:3000/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "finalDestinationCity": "Berlin" }

### Force a failure / timeout / flaky compensation anywhere
POST http://localhost:3000/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "simulate": { "failAt": "billing", "slowReplyAt": "customs", "flakyCompensationAt": "ocean-carrier" } }

### List sagas
GET http://localhost:3000/shipments

### One saga with its timeline (replace the id)
GET http://localhost:3000/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### What each participant's own DB holds for that saga
GET http://localhost:3000/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/participants

### Retry a COMPENSATION_FAILED saga
POST http://localhost:3000/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/retry-compensation
